# Yandex Maps JS API key, registered at https://yandex.ru/maps-api/console --
# product "JavaScript API и HTTP Геокодер" (the burial-place picker geocodes,
# so a map-only product is not enough). Full walkthrough:
# ../docs/yandex-maps.md
#
# Vite only reads .env files from this directory (frontend/), NOT from the
# repo root -- the root .env is the docker-compose one. Public but
# domain-restricted in the Yandex console. Without a key, MapView renders an
# inline explanatory message instead of crashing.
VITE_YANDEX_MAPS_API_KEY=your-yandex-maps-api-key-here
